    engine_specs_spec_runner_interpreter_divergence_2026-09-16, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep2-20261127: full divergence matrix on fresh HEAD seed (JIT via SIMPLE_JIT_SPEC_ENTRY=1 simple run). Shapes 1-3 (Option payload typing, enum non-optional return, cross-module type registry): already closed at tip by prior lanes - green on baseline, no action. Shape 4 (annotated local, RHS type wins) was TWO defects, both fixed: (a) interpreter - coerce_to_declared_signed/unsigned passed Value::Float through so var i: i64 = 0.0 stayed f64 (cannot index array with type f64); now converts via unified cast rules (truncate toward zero, saturate to width, matching explicit as) in node_exec.rs. (b) JIT - HIR never emitted a conversion for an annotated numeric let, so the raw float reached an i64 slot and read back 0 (var ix0: i64 = min_x rasterized with a zeroed origin); fixed in stmt_lowering.rs wrapping the initializer in the existing explicit-as cast lowering when the annotation disagrees (SIMPLE_DEBUG_CAST_TY proved annotated lets emitted no cast); operators.rs is_numeric_type_id made pub(crate). Spec test/01_unit/compiler/95.interp/interpreter/annotated_local_float_init_coerces_spec.spl baseline 1/4 RED to 4/4 GREEN on both lanes (in-process pins + subprocess differential). Fallout smoke all green (let_literal_type_mismatch 3/0, u64_field_store_coerces 11/0, while_block_local_val_parity 2/0, module_qualified_type_registry 8/0, jit_spec_entry 2/0). Residual R2 (not shape 4, not fixed): renderer3d_bugfix positioned-node pixels fail under JIT only - NodeStore3D.set_position self.nodes[i] = updated write lost on the JIT path; plain class-array stores pass on both engines; recorded as new bug jit_class_array_field_store_write_lost_2026-11-27 with repro build/p3cache/engspec/render_probe.spl. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/95.interp/interpreter/annotated_local_float_init_coerces_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/compiler/95.interp/interpreter/let_literal_type_mismatch_spec.spl"

